{"id":5648,"date":"2026-02-24T10:30:00","date_gmt":"2026-02-24T09:30:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=5648"},"modified":"2026-03-11T17:07:26","modified_gmt":"2026-03-11T16:07:26","slug":"why-you-are-the-deciding-factor-and-not-your-products-for-your-webshop","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/why-you-are-the-deciding-factor-and-not-your-products-for-your-webshop\/","title":{"rendered":"Why you (and not your product) are the deciding factor for your Webshop"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">You probably recognize this: you spend hours perfecting your product text, shooting stunning product photos, and fine-tuning your logo. But as soon as it comes to the &#8220;About Me&#8221; page, or that photo of yourself on the homepage, you might hesitate. &#8220;Doesn&#8217;t my product speak for itself?&#8221; or &#8220;Do people really care about my face?&#8221;. But did you know that customers actually want to buy from you?<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Nothing could be further from the truth. Especially as a starting entrepreneur, you are your most important asset. In this blog post, we&#8217;ll explain why hiding behind your logo is a waste of revenue, and how you can effortlessly create that personal connection.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tell your own story<\/font><\/font><\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Let&#8217;s face it: chances are there are others selling or doing roughly the same thing as you. In a world overflowing with options, the product is often the reason people search, but you&#8217;re the reason they stay and make a purchase.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">When a potential customer sees the driving force behind your company, a human connection is instantly created. People don&#8217;t buy from a business registration number; they buy from someone they feel comfortable with. Your passion, your smile, and even your unique personality create a trust factor that a large, anonymous organization can never match. Creating a strong corporate identity that truly reflects your personality is incredibly helpful.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:75px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why a face on your website immediately leads to more conversions<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">It&#8217;s even scientifically proven: our brains are programmed to recognize faces incredibly quickly. In a fraction of a second, we scan a photo to determine whether we can trust someone. This is what we call &#8220;social proof.&#8221;<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">The first 50 milliseconds:<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> Research shows that visitors form an opinion about your website in the blink of an eye. A human face ensures that first impression is immediately positive and &#8220;safe.&#8221;<\/font><\/font><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Oxytocin rush:<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> When we see a smiling face, our brains release a small amount of oxytocin, also known as the &#8220;cuddle hormone&#8221; or &#8220;trust hormone.&#8221; This lowers the barrier for your visitor to contact you.<\/font><\/font><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Recognition:<\/strong> We remember images much better than dry text. By showing yourself, you ensure that your brand is not just a name, but a person who stays with us.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">A website without a personal face can quickly feel cold and distant. By showing yourself, you lower the barrier to contact. A customer no longer thinks, &#8220;I&#8217;ll send an email to a company,&#8221; but rather, &#8220;I&#8217;ll send a quick message to [Your Name].&#8221; This lowered barrier to entry immediately leads to more inquiries, more sales, and loyal customers who feel connected to you.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:75px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">You don&#8217;t need an expensive photographer!<\/font><\/font><\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Many entrepreneurs put off &#8220;being visible&#8221; because they dread an expensive, posed photoshoot. But there&#8217;s no need! Those spontaneous, authentic photos often perform better than those stiff studio shots.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Here are a few tips to help you take a great photo today:<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Get help:<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> Ask a friend, family member, or partner to take photos of you for an hour. This creates a relaxed atmosphere, and that will definitely show in your photos.<\/font><\/font><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Seek out the light:<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> Stand outside or near a large window. Natural light is, of course, the best filter available.<\/font><\/font><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Keep it simple:<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> A simple background will keep the focus on you.<\/font><\/font><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Smile like you really do:<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> Think of something that makes you happy, or have the person taking the photo tell a joke. A genuine smile exudes confidence.<\/font><\/font><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Are you happy with your photos? Then don&#8217;t forget to upload them correctly. It&#8217;s important to optimize your images for Google, so your website is not only personalized but also easier to find.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:75px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Your product is the solution you offer, but you are the reason the customer chooses that solution. Dare to show yourself. It doesn&#8217;t have to be perfect; it should be genuine.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">My challenge to you:<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> Replace one generic image on your website or social media with a photo of yourself today. You&#8217;ll see the positive impact this will have on your website!<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-89b4c9e9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alignright\"><a class=\"w